{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/f0138382c5850e62c87dcfe9292f3d46.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pelikeeper</strong> is a cozy tower-defense and base building strategy game where you play as the last pelican trying to bring light back to a world swallowed by shadow. Rescue animal neighbors, build a thriving settlement around your lighthouse, and work together to defend fallen stars from waves of encroaching darkness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/8078d3aaaf5b0ad0cf7b6308a0d50502.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly to pockets of light across a fog-covered world and protect the crash-landed stars from shadow creatures!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your animal companion loadout\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy animal towers, each with distinct abilities and upgrade paths\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your pelican\u2019s abilities to strengthen towers and help defend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the line through escalating waves of shadow creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Trust to strengthen animal relationships</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success comes from choosing your animal loadout and crafting clever defensive upgrade strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/b26ad33f53b2426f1d7b47873517af81.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, fly home to your lighthouse and transform an old abandoned settlement into a warm, living town.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new projects, decorations, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check-in with your animal neighbours to build up Trust &amp; make the community stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the stories and personalities of each animal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your community grows, and you start working together, so does the power of your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/78dc74a98c8820dd6568a95e61f43ef2.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crash-landed stars you defend are used to rebuild constellations which return light to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new regions to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new animals with new towers and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your strategic defensive options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a ruined settlement into a beacon of hope strong enough to lift the shadow fog from the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/c8fedd0697f304aa8e5917dacd579176.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy tower-defense game mixed with relaxing base-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable lighthouse town full of charming animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen towers with unique abilities and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Symbiosis system that unlocks powerful community-driven buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple regions each containing multiple handcrafted levels</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657320?t=1773255191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657320?t=1773255191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/8127e4bf1209b8d84e0c244dafad885130197957/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773255191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/8127e4bf1209b8d84e0c244dafad885130197957/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773255191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3657330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>\u2b50Wishlist + Follow for Updates and Announcements\u2b50</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/c22b988b9f4fd05b9d962ff08ff7ee2a.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/f0138382c5850e62c87dcfe9292f3d46.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pelikeeper</strong> is a cozy tower-defense and base building strategy game where you play as the last pelican trying to bring light back to a world swallowed by shadow. Rescue animal neighbors, build a thriving settlement around your lighthouse, and work together to defend fal