ity grows, and you start working together, so does the power of your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/78dc74a98c8820dd6568a95e61f43ef2.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crash-landed stars you defend are used to rebuild constellations which return light to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new regions to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new animals with new towers and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your strategic defensive options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a ruined settlement into a beacon of hope strong enough to lift the shadow fog from the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/extras/c8fedd0697f304aa8e5917dacd579176.avif?t=1773255191\" width=1200 height=165 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy tower-defense game mixed with relaxing base-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable lighthouse town full of charming animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen towers with unique abilities and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Symbiosis system that unlocks powerful community-driven buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple regions each containing multiple handcrafted levels</p></li></ul>","developers":["Merge Conflict Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657320/a5ab6ce08bfc09c925d8a6497ddbd270a2049239/header.jpg?t=17732